_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222519015:1":{"text":"수십 개의 꿈을 넘나들다가 <style=\"highlight\">블랙본 해역</style>에서 고기를 잡는 어부의 꿈에 들어가게 됐거든요.","source_cn":"穿梭过几十个梦境，最后我进到一个在<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363F2CADA2325705","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222519016:1":{"text":"그때 갑자기 강력하고 사악한 마력을 느꼈어요!","source_cn":"就在那时，我突然感受到一股邪恶又汹涌的魔力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB00205CA47CCF48D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222519017:1":{"text":"블랙본 해역... 거긴 우리가 호드킨과 결전을 벌인 곳이잖아. 죽음의 함대가 다시 돌아온 건가?","source_cn":"黑棘海……那是我们和霍德希金决战的地方。是死潮舰队卷土...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF6FE611DEB615A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1222519018:1":{"text":"아니요! 당신이 생각하는 것보다 훨씬 끔찍한 일이 벌어졌어요!","source_cn":"不！傻傻的人类朋友！事实远比你想象得更恐怖！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90A7E577CA922AFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222519019:1":{"text":"그건 <style=\"highlight\">악마</style>였어요! 상어처럼 날카로운 이빨을 가진, 흉측하게 생긴 악마요!","source_cn":"那是<style=highlight>一个恶魔</st...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1F84EED04866F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":